        "created_at": "2014-01-14T22:33:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chaosmancer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/48/1977_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chaosmancer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Every time I look at this thread I have to look at the calendar and remind myself it isn't february so I need to stay patient… I'm not very good with patience</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Right?&nbsp; I keep thinking \"Surely, Vengeance will be out any day now and I can-\" … \"Oh…nope, nevermind…still January…\"</p>",
